msgstr "--gen fyller den nya världen: den kan inte kombineras med --no-use eller --dry-run"

#. command help: didact combat status
#: didact/commands/combat.py
msgid ""
"--gm adds each fighter's `where`, `doing` and `plan` details: keep them current\n"
"with `didact about <fighter> where='…' doing='…' plan='…'` as the fight moves.\n"
"Fighters come and go: `didact combat join <fighter>` brings one in, and\n"
"`didact combat leave <fighter> --why fled` takes one out."
msgstr ""
"--gm lägger till varje kombattants detaljer `where`, `doing` och `plan`: håll dem aktuella\n"
"med `didact about <fighter> where='…' doing='…' plan='…'` medan striden pågår.\n"
"Kombattanter kommer och går: `didact combat join <fighter>` tar in en, och\n"
"`didact combat leave <fighter> --why fled` tar ut en."

